Z||000028||TRiAD||07-30-2001||10:29 AM||||Leave it to our Government to call it  "rebate" when it's an advance...<P><BR>Anyway...I'm adopted, and found a PI that will locate both of my natural (birth) parents for the $600 I'm getting back. I'm 29 years old, so I figure I'm old enough to deal with whatever happens now...<P>It was an ugly situation, from what I've been told, malnutrition, improper care, the state took custody. She was like 15 years old, and this was the early '70s, so I figure there's no reason to hold any ill-will. I'm happy where I ended up, I just want to meet them. <P>I've instructed the PI to <B>not make contact</B>. I'm going to do that on my own terms. <P>...She may be married with kids and not have told them anything, I don't want to dirupt any lives. I figure I'll "look the situation" over from a distance first, then decide how to contact her alone. She may not want anything to do with me...and I think I'm prepared for that. <P>Anyway...I thought you'd find that interesting.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
